ong appreciation potential, it is ideal for both homeowners and investors seeking long-term value.Strategically located in Dubailand, Capria offers seamless connectivity via Shaikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road and Shaikh Zayed Bin Hamdan Road, with major attractions like Global Village and IMG Worlds of Adventure nearby. Within the community, residents enjoy forest pools, biking trails, an organic produce market, and wellness-focused amenities. With limited units available, securing a home here is a step toward an unparalleled lifestyle. Capria is more than a residence—it’s a gateway to refined, sustainable living.","price":1500000,"title":"Capria","bitrix":{"id":1145,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Capria","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Capria","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Majid Al Futtaim","project_location":"Ghaf Woods"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Capria_at_Ghafwoods_by_Majid_Al_Futtaim_7e132fe29c.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Capria_at_Ghafwoods_by_Majid_Al_Futtaim_7e132fe29c.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0523294,"lng":55.2221649},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/capria_g_11_6ef8138acb.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/capria_g_11_6ef8138acb.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/capria_g_1_863f96a876.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/capria_g_1_863f96a876.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/capria_g_10_6069acbc20.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/capria_g_10_6069acbc20.webp"}],"images2":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Capria_at_Ghafwoods_by_Majid_Al_Futtaim_7e132fe29c.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Capria_at_Ghafwoods_by_Majid_Al_Futtaim_7e132fe29c.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3